ون استتابة","مسألة بسيطة أجمع عليها العلماء","قضية بلا حكم شرعي"],"options_en":["A major disputed issue among scholars between treating it as a political crime or an internal religious matter","Consensus on immediate execution without repentance","A simple issue with scholarly consensus","An issue with no Sharia ruling"],"options_fr":["Une question majeure controversée parmi les savants entre la traiter comme un crime politique ou une affaire religieuse interne","Consensus sur l'exécution immédiate sans repentance","Une question simple avec consensus des savants","Une question sans jugement de la Charia"],"answer":0,"difficulty":"hard"},{"id":1050,"question":"ما هي الأبعاد التعليمية لـ'قصص القرآن' وأثرها في بناء الوعي التاريخي الإسلامي؟","question_en":"What are the educational dimensions of 'Quranic stories' and their impact on building Islamic historical consciousness?","question_fr":"Quelles sont les dimensions éducatives des 'récits coraniques' et leur impact sur la construction de la conscience historique islamique ?","options":["القصص آية معجزة تحمل عبراً تربوية وتُرسّخ الهوية الإيمانية وتُعلّم سنن الله في التاريخ","مجرد تسلية أدبية","تاريخ يُحفظ دون استخلاص عبر","أساطير لا قيمة تعليمية لها"],"options_en":["The stories are miraculous signs carrying moral lessons, establishing faith identity, and teaching Allah's laws in history","Merely literary entertainment","History memorized without drawing lessons","Myths with no educational value"],"options_fr":["Les récits sont des signes miraculeux portant des leçons morales, établissant l'identité de foi et enseignant les lois d'Allah dans l'histoire","Simplement un divertissement littéraire","Histoire mémorisée sans tirer de leçons","Mythes sans valeur éducative"],"answer":0,"difficulty":"hard"},{"id":1051,"question":"ما هي الحكمة من تعدد الأسماء الحسنى في الإسلام وأثرها على التصور الإلهي؟","question_en":"What is the wisdom behind the multiplicity of divine names (Al-Asma' Al-Husna) in Islam and their impact on the di